00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
Sugar dating or sugaring is a type of pseudoromantic interpersonal relationship where one
person receives money or gifts in exchange for intimacy or companionship.

11
01:04:32,000 --> 01:04:38,000
The provider (called a sugar daddy or sugar mommy) is typically older and wealthier, while the recipient (called a
sugar baby) is typically younger, attractive, and interested in improving their quality of life.

12
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
The recipient can obtain gifts such as jewelry, luxury goods, vacations, fine dining, mentorship, leisure outings, financial
support, and offers social benefits such as companionship, dedication, devotion, affection, dating or intimacy.

13
01:16:16,000 --> 01:16:22,000
Sugar dating is especially popular in the online dating community due
to the easy access to specific niches and desires.

14
01:22:08,000 --> 01:22:14,000
The tone is lighthearted and intense.
